    "q-95061": {
      "dom_id": "step-q95061",
      "name": "Question 16",
      "problem": "Find the principal axes of the curve $5{x}_{1}^{2}+24{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-5{x}_{2}^{2}=52.$",
      "worked_solution": "First, consider the quadratic form $Q(x)=5{x}_{1}^{2}+24{x}_{1}{x}_{2}-5{x}_{2}^{2}.$ The matrix of the form is\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -5\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNotice that $A$ is symmetric. The principal axes of the curve \n\n$$\n{x}^{T}\\,Ax=52\n$$\n\nare the vectors that form an orthonormal eigenvector basis of $A.$ \n\nBy solving the characteristic equation $|A-\\lambda I|=0,$ we obtain\n\n$\\,$ ${\\lambda }_{1}=13\\,$ and $\\,{\\lambda }_{2}=-13.$\n\nLet's now find the eigenvectors.\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{1}=13,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-13I & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -5\\end{aligned}]-13[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}-8 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -18\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-13I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{1}=[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{1}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{1}‖=\\sqrt{13},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{1}}{‖{v}_{1}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\n- For ${\\lambda }_{2}=-13,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A-(-13)I & =[\\begin{aligned}5 & 12 \\\\ 12 & -5\\end{aligned}]+13[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}18 & 12 \\\\ 12 & 8\\end{aligned}].\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSeeking a non-zero solution of $(A-13I)x=0$ gives the eigenvector ${v}_{2}=[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$ Dividing ${v}_{2}$ by its norm $‖{v}_{2}‖=\\sqrt{13},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\frac{{v}_{2}}{‖{v}_{2}‖}=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, the principal axes of our curve are\n\n$\\,$ $\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}3 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}]\\,$ and $\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{13}}[\\begin{aligned}-2 \\\\ 3\\end{aligned}].$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-95061-a",
              "type": "text",
